{"version":1,"content":"<p>內地影后章子怡的女兒「醒醒」是韓團i-dle中國籍成員宋雨琦的超級粉絲，章子怡曾陪女兒到日本追星，又幫女兒剪輯偶像的應援影片及製作禮物。</p><p>近日宋雨琦的首個個人音樂會在上海站收官，章子怡與女兒也有捧場，她還深夜在社交網發文鼓勵對方。</p><p>&lt;br</p>","scraped_at":"2026-11-02T04:21:10.519614+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":119,"images":0,"source":"東網 娛樂","fallback":"rss-budget","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-11-02T04:01:42+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-02T04:18:46.252693+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-02T04:18:46.252693+00:00","content_hash":"5984f2683e288baff19fab5ba420ea831a3543e263e6a8ef7c70a104fdd7a0a0","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}